    },
    "A card earns its recurring fee" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Une carte couvre ses frais annuels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ceiling, not a forecast — it assumes every purchase always lands on its best card. The per-card verdicts below are what each card actually contributes toward it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un plafond, pas une prévision — ce calcul suppose que chaque achat est porté sur la meilleure carte. Les résultats par carte ci-dessous indiquent la contribution réelle de chacune."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A possible fee waiver is unresolved; ranking uses the stated fee." : {
      "localizations" : {
